  "body": "Fixes #5597\n\nThe atlas-search via-service client built its ureq agent with timeouts only, so on hosts that reach the tailnet only through an HTTP CONNECT proxy (sandbox, codespaces, CI) the service path was unreachable and the CLI always fell back to standalone.\n\n- `service.rs`: the via-service agent is now built via `agent_with_proxy(ureq::Proxy::try_from_env())` — honoring `ALL_PROXY`/`HTTPS_PROXY`/`http_proxy` and `NO_PROXY` bypasses (ureq 3). With no proxy env set, behavior is unchanged (direct connect). The get-chunk health probe's agent gets the same proxy treatment.\n- `search_with_token` now delegates to `search_with_agent`, so tests can inject an explicit proxy.\n- Tests (oracle: the stub proxy's CONNECT log): `search_via_connect_proxy_tunnels_to_service` runs the full job protocol against a stub service through a stub CONNECT proxy and asserts every request was tunnelled to the service authority; `agent_with_no_proxy_connects_directly` pins the unchanged direct behavior.\n\nTests: `cargo test -p atlas-search` on the laptop — 30 unit + 8 cli_parity, all pass.\n\nQueue task 13552 (lane code-p).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796762959&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7810&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7810&signature=c7dee6f2d7a64cb23b3107dfd44cde5924ec55a31779b9be09d642cb09f78cdc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7810?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
